#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.view_page_become_a_member
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Becoming a member of Uplift means joining a "
"growing community of people who believe rivers and forests deserve real, "
"lasting protection: not just good intentions. <strong>Your membership "
"directly funds the work we do on the ground</strong>: cleaning polluted "
"riverbanks, replanting native trees, monitoring water quality, and "
"partnering with local communities who live alongside these ecosystems every "
"day.</span>"
msgstr ""

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.view_page_become_a_member
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">But membership is more than a donation. As "
"a member, you become part of the decision-making process, with "
"<strong>voting rights at our General Assembly</strong> to help shape the "
"direction of our campaigns and priorities. You'll also receive exclusive "
"updates from the field, giving you a front-row seat to the impact your "
"support makes possible: from newly restored forest sites to measurable "
"improvements in river health.</span>"
msgstr ""

