#~ msgid ""
#~ "Every day, communities around the world face discrimination,\n"
#~ "                                    exclusion, and silence. But together, "
#~ "we can rewrite that story.\n"
#~ "                                    Becoming a member of our organization "
#~ "isn’t just a\n"
#~ "                                    formality;&amp;nbsp;it’s a powerful "
#~ "act of solidarity. It’s\n"
#~ "                                    choosing to stand with those who have "
#~ "been silenced, to defend\n"
#~ "                                    the rights that protect us all, and "
#~ "to fight for a future where\n"
#~ "                                    no one is left behind."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Yhteisöt ympäri maailmaa kohtaavat päivittäin syrjintää,\n"
